A comment whose `;` lands mid-sentence; the next line begins with two
adjacent bare identifiers, which no SSL statement can start with. The
orphaned-prose path of comment_text_after_terminator fires at warning
(issue #25; diag.comment_text_after_terminator fourth Flags fence shape).
